iji-118-huainan:m001-0051","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p001","quote":"趙王敖"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0126","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p001","quote":"趙王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p007","quote":"武臣到邯鄲，自立為趙王，陳餘為大將軍，張耳、召騷為左右丞相。陳王怒，捕系武臣等家室，欲誅之。柱國曰：「秦未亡而誅趙王將相家屬，此生一秦也。不如因而立之。」陳王乃遣使者賀趙，而徙系武臣等家屬宮中，而封耳子張敖為成都君，趣趙兵亟入關。趙王將相相與謀曰：「王王趙，非楚意也。楚已誅秦，必加兵於趙。計莫如毋西兵，使使北徇燕地以自廣也。趙南據大河，北有燕、代，楚雖勝秦，不敢制趙。若楚不勝秦，必重趙。趙乘秦之獘，可以得志於天下。」趙王以為然，因不西兵，而遣故上谷卒史韓廣將兵北徇燕地。","source_term":"耳子張敖"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji048-001","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"agx_sqm_4ou"}},{"id":"agx_sqm_4ou_AB","label":"張壽（張耳陳餘列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"壽","mention_ids":["c-shiji-009-lvhou:m019-0035","c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0049"]},{"surface":"樂昌侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0051","c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0081"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m019-0035","chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p019","quote":"壽"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0049","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"壽"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0051","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"樂昌侯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0081","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"樂昌侯"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029","quote":"張敖，髙后六年薨。子偃爲魯元王。以母呂后女故，呂后封爲魯元王。元王弱，兄弟少，乃封張敖他姬子二人：壽爲樂昌侯，侈爲信都侯。髙后崩，諸呂無道，大臣誅之，而廢魯元王及樂昌侯、信諸侯。孝文帝即位，復封故魯元王偃爲南宮侯，續張氏。","source_term":"張敖他姬子二人"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji089-011","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"agx_sqm_4ou_A"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-089","chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0049","c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0051","c-shiji-089-zhanger:m029-0081"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029"],"passage_count":1},{"source_id":"s-shiji-009-lvhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-009-lvhou:m019-0035"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-009-lvhou:p019"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-089-zhanger"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji009-017","subject_person_id":"agx_sqm_4ou_AB","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"agx_sqm_4ou_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p019","quote":"乃封張敖前姬兩子，侈為新都侯，壽為樂昌侯","chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","source_id":"s-shiji-009-lvhou"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"兩子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"僅保存原文明示主張，不補闕代、同父同母或未見姓名；不推導少帝生物父親。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji089-011","subject_person_id":"agx_sqm_4ou_AB","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"agx_sqm_4ou_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p029"